d beyond):**\n\n* The bruise is now fully healed, and the skin is fully restored to its normal color and texture.\n* The skin is no longer sensitive to touch or pressure.\n* The bruise is completely gone, and the skin is smooth and normal.\n\nKeep in mind that everyone's healing process is different, and the color of the bruise can vary from person to person.","wall_seconds":100.94361996650696}
